abstract: >
  LC-MS Data Processor is an open-source Python workflow
  for chromatogram processing, peak integration,
  calibration-curve fitting, quantification,
  and quality-control reporting. The software
  provides a reproducible framework for LC-MS
  data analysis using exported time-intensity
  chromatogram data and includes visualization,
  reporting, and educational workflow examples.
